# Potential DCOM InternetExplorer.Application DLL Hijack - Image Load | T1021.002, T1021.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/image_load/image_load_iexplore_dcom_iertutil_dll_hijack.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=7 Image="*\\Internet Explorer\\iexplore.exe" ImageLoaded="*\\Internet Explorer\\iertutil.dll"
